$\Sigma_t$. Formally:
\begin{equation}
\partial\mathcal{M} = \lim_{r \rightarrow \infty} \Sigma_t(r),
\end{equation}
where $r$ is a radial coordinate in the bulk.

The boundary inherits:
\begin{itemize}
    \item the induced metric $\gamma_{AB}$,
